/-!
# `ChainExPostFactoG` — Part C: `mem_reach_of_asked`, the transcript→`ChainKnow` simulation

Work file of `bc-a359729a` (the band-chain prover), in parallel with `bc-35b053cc`'s framework; it edits none of their
files. The contract is `internal/p3-instantiation/chain-epf-interface.md`.

**The contracted statement is false** (see the dated note of 2026-09-28 02:55Z in the contract, and
