/-- **At `N = 1` the union `π` is the one-segment `chainPi`.** -/
theorem chainPiSeg_one (B ℓ c D Q β : ℕ) : chainPiSeg 1 B ℓ c D Q β = chainPi B ℓ c D Q β := by
